","address":"3336 Magazine St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70115","stars":4.5,"review_count":31,"categories":["Street Vendors","Food","Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt"],"is_open":false},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1630,"mm_rank":1467,"target_category_support_fraction":0.3333333333333333,"selected_image_count":4,"label_diversity":1,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Street Vendors","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","review_id":"jUf7G6SbDTtqWOev4pDYKQ","date":"2017-06-29T20:25:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944913387298584,"text_excerpt":"I was pleasantly surprised by Dat Ice Roll. They have a small cart outside the Dat Dog restaurant on Magazine, but they do change locations since it's a cart. You may want to check Instagram or Face Book to see where they are on the weekends. I was in the area one Saturday and noticed the line, so I went to investigate. I believe they offered about 6 flavors the day I was there and although a line had gathered it went very quickly. It's $5 for one size and it may not seem like it at first, but you get your money's worth. The ice cream is so smooth and creamy and it tastes excellent. I had the café au lait flavor and it was perfection. It's a lot of fun to see how they pour out the mix and..."},{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","review_id":"pMfe3arPYQ_ZoODCr8HJJA","date":"2017-04-07T19:24:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9119827747344971,"text_excerpt":"Don't forget to say your please and thank you or be prepared for paying a higher price :) Manners matter! This was a very cute pop up right next to Dat Dog, if you're smart you get your ice cream here, get a beer at Dat Dog, and then sit in the outdoor patio and enjoy it all. The ice cream rolls are made to order, and made with the mixings you like. The fruit flavors are very fresh and clean. It's a great treat when walking along Magazine."},{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","review_id":"bD5jU6EFBvUy1i_3mHmh8Q","date":"2016-08-26T21:25:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.911068320274353,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome and worth looking for! Contrary to another review, these guys do speak and understand English very well. They have a very amazing selection and are like artists when it comes to making this stuff. It's just a little booth beside Dat Dog. These guys are very attentive and interactive. If you are out that way and looking for a new ice cream experience try these guys out!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","photo_id":"h6a_r_CZb_cvJvOWVMQNYA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/h6a_r_CZb_cvJvOWVMQNYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9141666889190674},{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","photo_id":"1g9yLKexxnIvEKI7oDpkwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1g9yLKexxnIvEKI7oDpkwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9047012329101562},{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","photo_id":"p7YkmM7LDqIqT2gH7EP5_g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/p7YkmM7LDqIqT2gH7EP5_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8984485864639282},{"business_id":"d7nBe3AX5IihO56neUax0Q","photo_id":"lRktMvM7OsjNDMR2RZGpyw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lRktMvM7OsjNDMR2RZGpyw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8485606908798218}]},"notebook_case":null}
